OL,3,GNEWSACouncil offers free car parking
OL,4,Ascheme for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoppers will be able to park for free
OL,7,Ffor up to two hours at two
OL,8,Fcouncil-owned car parks in Loughborough
OL,9,Ftown centre in the run-up to Christmas.
OL,11,FCharnwood Borough Council announced the
OL,12,Fscheme will apply at the Granby Street
OL,13,Fand Beehive Lane car parks from 2
OL,14,FNovember to 3 January 2027.
OL,16,FThe authority said that the scheme was
OL,17,Fto encourage more people to visit the
OL,18,Ftown centre during the festive period
OL,19,Fand support retailers, the hospitality
OL,20,Fsector, market traders and other
OL,21,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
