OL,3,GNEWSACouncil offers free car parking
OL,4,Ascheme for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the council, any stay
OL,7,Flonger than two hours would incur the
OL,8,Ffull parking charge for the entire
OL,9,Fvisit, including the initial two-hour
OL,10,Fperiod.
